; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 12. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'dc31_rescuer'
dc31_rescuer.dialogstring_05ABC6! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]Man's voice: He should be[N]getting up about now; he[N]should be fine.[FIN]If he takes enough[N]vitamin C he should even[N]get over his fatigue.[FIN]This is what you call[N]"scurvy", you know.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]If you don't take[N]vitamin C for a long time[N]you're going to contract[N]the disease.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Ugh…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]The famous explorer[N]Columbus's troop once[N]contracted the disease.[FIN]It's not something to[N]concern yourself about.[FIN]If the disease gets worse,[N]your blood goes bad and[N]your skin darkens.[FIN]You bleed from the gums,[N]and soon enough, your body[N]withers…[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Stop it! I don't[N]want to hear a scary story[N]like that![FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]Man: Hahahaha. Well, more[N]importantly, he's safe.[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: But, sir, you[N]really know a lot, huh?[N]I'm really grateful.[FIN][::][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]If you're going to thank[N]someone, thank the dog[N]outside.[FIN]After all, they found you[N]two while I was taking[N]them out.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'dc31_kara'
dc31_kara.dialogstring_05ADAE! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Will! Will!![N]Wake up…!![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]It's land, we've reached[N]land! We've been[N]saved…!![FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: U-uugh…[END]`
dc31_kara.dialogstring_05AE00! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Huh[AD] Kara[AD]?[N]Where are we?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: In the home of the[N]man who saved us.[WAI][N]Good grief, Will. You kept[N]throwing off the blankets[N]no matter how many times I[N]put them back.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'dc31_rescuer'
dc31_rescuer.dialogstring_05AEA3! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]Man: This is the southern[N]outskirts of Oakland.[WAI][N][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]If you head north for[N]about half a day, you'll[N]reach Freejia, the Capital[N]of Flowers.[WAI][N]If you're looking for the[N]friends you were separated[N]from, a big city is your[N]best chance.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'dc31_kara'
dc31_kara.dialogstring_05AF2F! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Anyway, let's head[N]for that city called[N]Freejia.[WAI][N]I'm going to thank the[N]dog first.[WAI][N]Come talk to me when[N]you're ready to leave.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'dc30_dog'
dc30_dog.dialogstring_05AA91! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1]Woof woof!![END]`

?INCLUDE 'dc30_kara'
dc30_kara.dialogstring_05AADD! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: He said this dog's[N]name is Turbo. He's[N]pretty clever, huh?[WAI][N]Alright, let's go. We'll[N]find Lilly, Lance, and[N]Erik.[FIN][CLD][DEF]The two head toward the[N]Capital of Flowers,[N]Freejia.[END]`
